# ...but these two are committed ON PURPOSE (local connection strings only,
# no secrets) and a fresh clone needs them to run the suites:
#   .env.test — the test-suite database (docs/TESTING.md)
#   .env.sim  — the simulation database (docs/SIMULATION_TESTING.md)
# They are already tracked, so the rule above does not affect them today;
# these negations keep that true if they are ever removed and re-added.
